data: {"id": "baaf2ac1dbf149c7-thinking-parallel_evidence-1306", "run_id": "baaf2ac1dbf149c7", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实、冲突与缺口\n\n- 实体身份与生命周期\n  - Pod workload-5c9c7b6489-p8462，namespace: aiops-case-08，UID: 7f2eda43-58bc-4f48-bb8a-02435553f7d1，调度在 node2/10.2.0.50，IP 172.16.104.11，当前 STATUS: Running，1/1 READY，RESTARTS: 11（最近一次 5m22s 前），总存活约 41m。身份一致，未见复用冲突。\n\n- 支持“CrashLoopBackOff 根因为 OOMKilled”的证据\n  - kubectl_describe 显示容器退出原因为 OOMKilled，Exit Code 137；kubelet 持续在 60s 间隔回退重启（142次，跨度39m），符合“容器被 OOM 终止—重启—再被 OOM 终止”的循环特征。\n  - kubectl_events 的“Back-off restarting failed container app”与上述行为一致。\n  - kubectl_get_by_nam", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789080048102, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

